After running 'expo prebuild --platform android', apply this manual patch to
mobile_app/android/app/src/main/java/com/ishant/mobile_app/MainApplication.java
(or MainApplication.kt for Kotlin).

Find the line in getPackages() that reads:
    packages.add(new MainReactPackage());
  OR in newer Expo:
    return PackageList(this).packages

For Java, add before the return statement:
    packages.add(new PythonServerPackage());

For Kotlin, override getPackages():
    override fun getPackages(): List<ReactPackage> {
        val packages = PackageList(this).packages
        packages.add(PythonServerPackage())
        return packages
    }

The setup_release.sh --android script copies the Java files automatically and
prints a reminder. If you use Kotlin, convert PythonServerModule/Package manually.
